</article>)}</div>

    <div class="mt-14 card overflow-x-auto">
<h2 class="px-5 py-4 font-serif text-2xl font-black text-white">Shortlist by operating job</h2>
<table class="data-table">
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Job</th>
<th>First candidates</th>
<th>Evidence to request</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Deep Shopify segmentation</td>
<td>Klaviyo, Omnisend, ActiveCampaign</td>
<td>Event sync, catalog fields, suppression export</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Combined email + SMS + push</td>
<td>Omnisend; verify all three channels in the proposed plan</td>
<td>Flow setup time, channel permissions, caps</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>SMS-first recovery</td>
<td>Postscript, Recart, Attentive</td>
<td>Consent log, STOP/HELP, incremental holdout</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Permissioned list growth</td>
<td>Privy, Omnisend, Postscript</td>
<td>Disclosure copy, source field, opt-in timestamp</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Email workflow alternatives</td>
<td>Shopify Email, Brevo, Sequenzy, Mailchimp</td>
<td>Current SMS scope where needed; email volume and integration path</td>
</tr>
<tr><td>Browser-push experiment</td><td>Firepush; Omnisend for a combined builder</td><td>Push opt-in, expiry, purchase exit and channel collisions</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
